(6265582, 927441, 60173, '<td valign="top">The heat in the orange on the right side is a great balance for her beautiful skin tones and brings out the subtle reds in her hair. I think I would have taken just a little of the yellows out of the "whites" of her eyes. I think making them completely white would look unnatural given the hues of the photo, but they do seem a touch too yellow.</td>', 'The heat in the orange on the right side is a great balance for her beautiful skin tones and brings out the subtle reds in her hair. I think I would have taken just a little of the yellows out of the "whites" of her eyes. I think making them completely white would look unnatural given the hues of the photo, but they do seem a touch too yellow.', '2011-01-01 00:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6265584, 925636, 60173, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit of a sharpening halo on the boat. Overall has a nice feel though, and is well composed and exposed.</td>', 'Quite a bit of a sharpening halo on the boat. Overall has a nice feel though, and is well composed and exposed.', '2011-01-01 00:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
