(6265804, 926868, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a pretty scene and the colour gradient in the sky is tremendous. Personally though, this looks like you''ve been a bit heavy with the sharpening to me (something I''m prone to do myself) - I think this delicate scene would better suit a smooth rather than crisp treatment. This appearance is particularly prominent in the lower left foreground foliage which is also quite bright and thus accentuates the over-sharpened look.<br/> <br/>Perhaps it is jpeg artifaction, if I look in the upper branches of the tree I can see a cross-hatch pattern...<br/> <br/>Overall, clearly a beautiful scene with outstanding colour handling but for me, the sharpening / compression combination takes the shine off it.</td>', 'This is certainly a pretty scene and the colour gradient in the sky is tremendous. Personally though, this looks like you''ve been a bit heavy with the sharpening to me (something I''m prone to do myself) - I think this delicate scene would better suit a smooth rather than crisp treatment. This appearance is particularly prominent in the lower left foreground foliage which is also quite bright and thus accentuates the over-sharpened look. Perhaps it is jpeg artifaction, if I look in the upper branches of the tree I can see a cross-hatch pattern... Overall, clearly a beautiful scene with outstanding colour handling but for me, the sharpening / compression combination takes the shine off it.', '2011-01-01 06:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
