(6265951, 924791, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like blurry people pictures so this one was always going to push a button for me. I like this image, especially the neck and the ''Picasso-esque'' relationship of the nose to the rest of the face.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: This is a bold image and I would''ve perhaps liked to have seen a slightly bolder treatment - a bit more contrast to make that back lighting stand out a little more (?)<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nice though - a bit of a treat to find in a FS.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like blurry people pictures so this one was always going to push a button for me. I like this image, especially the neck and the ''Picasso-esque'' relationship of the nose to the rest of the face. Critical stuff: This is a bold image and I would''ve perhaps liked to have seen a slightly bolder treatment - a bit more contrast to make that back lighting stand out a little more (?) Overall: Very nice though - a bit of a treat to find in a FS.', '2011-01-01 08:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6265954, 927438, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful wintery scene. The stark white against blue is really great.<br/>But I do think this photo could be enhanced further. That tree in the foreground, while adding depth to the photo, is casting a shadow that feels like it''s cutting through the serenity of this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful wintery scene. The stark white against blue is really great.But I do think this photo could be enhanced further. That tree in the foreground, while adding depth to the photo, is casting a shadow that feels like it''s cutting through the serenity of this photo.', '2011-01-01 09:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
