(6266546, 926633, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea in this photo, but I''m not liking the photo itself. I think it''s because of the selective saturation on a burry part of the photo.</td>', 'I like the idea in this photo, but I''m not liking the photo itself. I think it''s because of the selective saturation on a burry part of the photo.', '2011-01-01 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266547, 926462, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but a bit overly busy for my eyes.</td>', 'Nice colors, but a bit overly busy for my eyes.', '2011-01-01 19:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266548, 924530, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hey this looks really effective, would look good in a picture frame. I like how you focused on the leaf and the wire in the middle of the photo and blurred the rest.</td>', 'Hey this looks really effective, would look good in a picture frame. I like how you focused on the leaf and the wire in the middle of the photo and blurred the rest.', '2011-01-01 19:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266549, 924475, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule of thirds and I do like the close crop. But this photo is lacking pop for me. I think it''s a lack of contrast, actually.</td>', 'Good use of the rule of thirds and I do like the close crop. But this photo is lacking pop for me. I think it''s a lack of contrast, actually.', '2011-01-01 19:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266550, 927222, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like what you have here.  The image quality is very nice and the dogs expression is compelling.  I wish you would have left a little more image on top and bottom.  The bottom crop of his paws is to harsh for me.  You should still score quite well.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like what you have here.  The image quality is very nice and the dogs expression is compelling.  I wish you would have left a little more image on top and bottom.  The bottom crop of his paws is to harsh for me.  You should still score quite well.  Good luck!', '2011-01-01 19:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266551, 927374, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good scene, but I''m not too keen on the fully blown out sky.</td>', 'A good scene, but I''m not too keen on the fully blown out sky.', '2011-01-01 19:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266552, 925405, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very good scene to capture. Unfortunately, I think you just missed on having a really beautiful photo. Seems you may have used some HDR technique that is causing some un-naturalness to this scene.</td>', 'A very good scene to capture. Unfortunately, I think you just missed on having a really beautiful photo. Seems you may have used some HDR technique that is causing some un-naturalness to this scene.', '2011-01-01 19:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266553, 926263, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow the thumb nail jumped right out to me, so I had to view this, and i wasn''t dissapointed, one of the better ones so far in this challenge. Really love how you used the lamp in the photo, always a good prop. 10</td>', 'Wow the thumb nail jumped right out to me, so I had to view this, and i wasn''t dissapointed, one of the better ones so far in this challenge. Really love how you used the lamp in the photo, always a good prop. 10', '2011-01-01 19:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6266554, 925933, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''m just not finding this photo interesting at all. MAybe if you concentrated more on the cart and the nearby light, and removed all the other distracting elements it would be been nicer.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''m just not finding this photo interesting at all. MAybe if you concentrated more on the cart and the nearby light, and removed all the other distracting elements it would be been nicer.', '2011-01-01 19:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
