(6266557, 927404, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, but the whole photo feels very soft to me. Looks like the movement of the stars due to a long shutter is more of a mistake than a conscious decision.</td>', 'Wonderful idea, but the whole photo feels very soft to me. Looks like the movement of the stars due to a long shutter is more of a mistake than a conscious decision.', '2011-01-01 19:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
