(6267120, 927209, 12405, '<td valign="top">very nice, great detail, I''m almost looking for the wires that are holding the birds in place, if it wasn''t for the motion blur I would have though they are fake birds so you could get this close and with that detail.<br/> <br/>Hope there is a bit of the behind the scenes on this one, but until then well done.</td>', 'very nice, great detail, I''m almost looking for the wires that are holding the birds in place, if it wasn''t for the motion blur I would have though they are fake birds so you could get this close and with that detail. Hope there is a bit of the behind the scenes on this one, but until then well done.', '2011-01-02 10:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267121, 926175, 12405, '<td valign="top">For me, in this time of bah humbug. I found this one of the best Christmas photos I''ve seen in a while. the lights just out of focus as to not cause to much of a distraction, the bell crystal clear, reflective, and very simple frame. Though can''t quite give it a 10 because I keep finding my eyes on the red background on the right side. If that was darkened out some I think I would have gone 10. But I''m giving it a 9.</td>', 'For me, in this time of bah humbug. I found this one of the best Christmas photos I''ve seen in a while. the lights just out of focus as to not cause to much of a distraction, the bell crystal clear, reflective, and very simple frame. Though can''t quite give it a 10 because I keep finding my eyes on the red background on the right side. If that was darkened out some I think I would have gone 10. But I''m giving it a 9.', '2011-01-02 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
