(6267141, 926425, 12405, '<td valign="top">Great mood piece, great contrast, reflections, etc. The vignetting pulls you into the center, where really the only thing the eye has to focus on is the little island. I love looking at the contrast etc, but in the end my eye is looking for a place to go. I guess since the vignetting is pulling to the center I should be looking into the center. Which is off in a foggy distance. Could be that this is s dark way of looking at the future? beautiful but at the same time kind of menacing, so watch your step! hehe.. well done.</td>', 'Great mood piece, great contrast, reflections, etc. The vignetting pulls you into the center, where really the only thing the eye has to focus on is the little island. I love looking at the contrast etc, but in the end my eye is looking for a place to go. I guess since the vignetting is pulling to the center I should be looking into the center. Which is off in a foggy distance. Could be that this is s dark way of looking at the future? beautiful but at the same time kind of menacing, so watch your step! hehe.. well done.', '2011-01-02 10:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
