(6267463, 926633, 91783, '<td valign="top">for this particular shot i dont like the selective desateration. if the flowers themselves were in focus it would help make it look better, but they''re not so it looks a little funny. Its kind of distracting with a big bright yellow blur is there and the actual subject blends in with the background color wise. <br/> <br/>with all of that said, i think that its a great moment captured, that just wasnt edited right.</td>', 'for this particular shot i dont like the selective desateration. if the flowers themselves were in focus it would help make it look better, but they''re not so it looks a little funny. Its kind of distracting with a big bright yellow blur is there and the actual subject blends in with the background color wise.  with all of that said, i think that its a great moment captured, that just wasnt edited right.', '2011-01-02 14:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
