(6267707, 926462, 99120, '<td valign="top">Autumn is a wonderful time of year but I feel this image needs some ground to give a contrast to the colours and your blurred border doesn''t seem necessary.</td>', 'Autumn is a wonderful time of year but I feel this image needs some ground to give a contrast to the colours and your blurred border doesn''t seem necessary.', '2011-01-02 18:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267708, 926698, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the multiple layers to this photograph. The black and white really helps with this moody shot. Great work. 7</td>', 'I love the multiple layers to this photograph. The black and white really helps with this moody shot. Great work. 7', '2011-01-02 18:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267709, 926698, 96751, '<td valign="top">An image worthy of deep exploration. There are many layers, each offering visual delights.  The front frame has strong diagonal lines, and interesting remnants which could either be ice or glass.  The room behind it is filled with mystery and delicious tonal variances, making me wonder what happened in there, what longing soul peered out these windows and longed to be elsewhere.  The distant building seems foreboding and almost caricature-ish - like a sorcerer''s castle designed by Rube Goldberg.  As lovely as it is, we miss an anchoring element, something the typical viewer can relate to, without having to weave their own story.  With the large number of entries in the typical FS, an intellectually stimulating image such as this suffers greatly.</td>', 'An image worthy of deep exploration. There are many layers, each offering visual delights.  The front frame has strong diagonal lines, and interesting remnants which could either be ice or glass.  The room behind it is filled with mystery and delicious tonal variances, making me wonder what happened in there, what longing soul peered out these windows and longed to be elsewhere.  The distant building seems foreboding and almost caricature-ish - like a sorcerer''s castle designed by Rube Goldberg.  As lovely as it is, we miss an anchoring element, something the typical viewer can relate to, without having to weave their own story.  With the large number of entries in the typical FS, an intellectually stimulating image such as this suffers greatly.', '2011-01-02 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267710, 927276, 99120, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of glare in this image. Perhaps moving to a different position and getting closer to some of the interesting elements in this garden may have helped.</td>', 'There is a lot of glare in this image. Perhaps moving to a different position and getting closer to some of the interesting elements in this garden may have helped.', '2011-01-02 18:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267712, 924437, 115307, '<td valign="top">The crop is a bit tight for me. I would like to see a little bit more room between the left horses nose and the bottom of the frame. I do love the mood of this photograph though. So tender. 6</td>', 'The crop is a bit tight for me. I would like to see a little bit more room between the left horses nose and the bottom of the frame. I do love the mood of this photograph though. So tender. 6', '2011-01-02 18:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
