(6267882, 927408, 114225, '<td valign="top">This thing is creepy. But nice job being brave enough to get a shot of him.</td>', 'This thing is creepy. But nice job being brave enough to get a shot of him.', '2011-01-02 20:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267883, 927104, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creative use of tilt shift. The lines in the grass meat up nicely with the focal plane.</td>', 'Creative use of tilt shift. The lines in the grass meat up nicely with the focal plane.', '2011-01-02 20:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267887, 927459, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful emotion in this portrait. I love how the face of the dog says "stop smothering me!"</td>', 'Wonderful emotion in this portrait. I love how the face of the dog says "stop smothering me!"', '2011-01-02 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267889, 926984, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how the icicle interrupts the flow of the bird, but also adds a sense of dynamic-ness to this.</td>', 'It''s interesting how the icicle interrupts the flow of the bird, but also adds a sense of dynamic-ness to this.', '2011-01-02 20:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267893, 927497, 114225, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice portrait, but I feel it lacks something. I can''t quite put my finger on it, maybe there should be more detail in the dress??</td>', 'Overall, a nice portrait, but I feel it lacks something. I can''t quite put my finger on it, maybe there should be more detail in the dress??', '2011-01-02 20:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267894, 927266, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like your use of black and white in thi. I wish the background wasn''t quite as cluttered (or visible).</td>', 'I like your use of black and white in thi. I wish the background wasn''t quite as cluttered (or visible).', '2011-01-02 20:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267895, 927163, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you decided to give this a vintage look. It''s well done.</td>', 'Interesting that you decided to give this a vintage look. It''s well done.', '2011-01-02 20:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267896, 925993, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice details in the eyes, and the 2:00 catch lights are well placed.</td>', 'Nice details in the eyes, and the 2:00 catch lights are well placed.', '2011-01-02 20:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267897, 924554, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good complimentary colors in this photo.</td>', 'Good complimentary colors in this photo.', '2011-01-02 20:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267898, 927280, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I really like where you are going with this. I feel this could have been even more powerful with a lower perspective to make the landscape feel more expansive.</td>', 'Interesting. I really like where you are going with this. I feel this could have been even more powerful with a lower perspective to make the landscape feel more expansive.', '2011-01-02 20:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267900, 923284, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I like the view of looking through the weeds. I find myself wishing it were a little more sharp.</td>', 'This is nice. I like the view of looking through the weeds. I find myself wishing it were a little more sharp.', '2011-01-02 20:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267901, 927265, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job balancing exposures in this photo. Funny, that yellow car doesn''t scream "camping" to me. Unfortunately, it keeps dragging my attention to it.</td>', 'Nice job balancing exposures in this photo. Funny, that yellow car doesn''t scream "camping" to me. Unfortunately, it keeps dragging my attention to it.', '2011-01-02 20:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267902, 926818, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, with nice depth of field to really drawer the focus in.</td>', 'Cute photo, with nice depth of field to really drawer the focus in.', '2011-01-02 20:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267903, 927386, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great splash of color for this scene. Plus the tilt really gives a dynamic feel to this (I find my eyes rolling down the hill).</td>', 'Great splash of color for this scene. Plus the tilt really gives a dynamic feel to this (I find my eyes rolling down the hill).', '2011-01-02 20:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267904, 927427, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone is setting up for an interesting photo shoot. Nice job have the silhouettes crisp.</td>', 'Looks like someone is setting up for an interesting photo shoot. Nice job have the silhouettes crisp.', '2011-01-02 20:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267905, 927418, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the immensity of this event.</td>', 'Great job capturing the immensity of this event.', '2011-01-02 20:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267906, 925685, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like how the background and style of clothing really setup a context.</td>', 'Cute. I like how the background and style of clothing really setup a context.', '2011-01-02 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267907, 927359, 115307, '<td valign="top">Haha, this made me laugh out loud. Never have I seen a sea lion look so wide-eyed. Such a funny expression and tack sharp to boot. 8</td>', 'Haha, this made me laugh out loud. Never have I seen a sea lion look so wide-eyed. Such a funny expression and tack sharp to boot. 8', '2011-01-02 20:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267908, 924050, 114225, '<td valign="top">I could see this being a motivational poster. I really like how the sun rays point towards the dolphins.</td>', 'I could see this being a motivational poster. I really like how the sun rays point towards the dolphins.', '2011-01-02 20:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267909, 926833, 114225, '<td valign="top">Huh, the first time I looked at this, I didn''t see the people waling down the road. That adds an extra bit of interest.</td>', 'Huh, the first time I looked at this, I didn''t see the people waling down the road. That adds an extra bit of interest.', '2011-01-02 20:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267910, 927046, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the blue in the water is a stark contrast to the purplish feel of the clouds.</td>', 'I like how the blue in the water is a stark contrast to the purplish feel of the clouds.', '2011-01-02 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267912, 927185, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job with this. Decent details and very nice composition.</td>', 'Nice job with this. Decent details and very nice composition.', '2011-01-02 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267913, 927108, 114225, '<td valign="top">I definitely like this photo. That bit of yellow catches the eye.</td>', 'I definitely like this photo. That bit of yellow catches the eye.', '2011-01-02 20:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267914, 926175, 114225, '<td valign="top">Basic, but effective. Brings together the colors and details of the season. One thing I''m not too fond of is the reflection in the bell of your room. Hard to avoid this, unless maybe you hang some large white sheets from the ceiling.</td>', 'Basic, but effective. Brings together the colors and details of the season. One thing I''m not too fond of is the reflection in the bell of your room. Hard to avoid this, unless maybe you hang some large white sheets from the ceiling.', '2011-01-02 20:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267917, 925836, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the processing that was done on this. I am very curious what the steps were.<br/>I would have liked to see a more eye level angle, rather than looking down. Great colors and sharpness here though. 8</td>', 'I love the processing that was done on this. I am very curious what the steps were.I would have liked to see a more eye level angle, rather than looking down. Great colors and sharpness here though. 8', '2011-01-02 20:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267918, 927211, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of symetry and repeating elements here. It''s cool how there are bird reflections in the right window.</td>', 'Good use of symetry and repeating elements here. It''s cool how there are bird reflections in the right window.', '2011-01-02 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267920, 925883, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is neat. The lines in the sand add a lot of competing yet complimentary dynamics.</td>', 'This is neat. The lines in the sand add a lot of competing yet complimentary dynamics.', '2011-01-02 20:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267922, 927210, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. It really sets up a sense of scale by having the person walking through.</td>', 'I like this. It really sets up a sense of scale by having the person walking through.', '2011-01-02 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267925, 923677, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice job having the silhouettes crisp and clear, and I like how there are rays of light flowing through the sky.</td>', 'Very nice job having the silhouettes crisp and clear, and I like how there are rays of light flowing through the sky.', '2011-01-02 20:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267926, 927222, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is nice. The look on it''s face really tells a story.</td>', 'This is nice. The look on it''s face really tells a story.', '2011-01-02 20:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267927, 927186, 114225, '<td valign="top">At first, I was confused by the curved chimneys, until I saw the title and sign. Nice viewpoint on this exhibit.</td>', 'At first, I was confused by the curved chimneys, until I saw the title and sign. Nice viewpoint on this exhibit.', '2011-01-02 20:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267929, 927358, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool fungus. Really feels alive.</td>', 'That''s a really cool fungus. Really feels alive.', '2011-01-02 20:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267934, 927209, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am assuming this is William?<br/>Holy Smokes! Every time I think you have created the perfect hummingbird picture, you crank out another that is even better! Really hoping that this one doesn''t get disqualified, and that you place really high. 9</td>', 'I am assuming this is William?Holy Smokes! Every time I think you have created the perfect hummingbird picture, you crank out another that is even better! Really hoping that this one doesn''t get disqualified, and that you place really high. 9', '2011-01-02 20:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267936, 927357, 115307, '<td valign="top">Too over processed for me, but very interesting subject matter</td>', 'Too over processed for me, but very interesting subject matter', '2011-01-02 20:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267946, 925993, 115307, '<td valign="top">I spent quite a bit of time looking through recent entries because I was so sure that this was an exact replica of another entry, and going crazy because I couldn''t find it but was so sure that I had seen it. I finally realized I saw it on 1x. Awesome shot! On this site and that one.</td>', 'I spent quite a bit of time looking through recent entries because I was so sure that this was an exact replica of another entry, and going crazy because I couldn''t find it but was so sure that I had seen it. I finally realized I saw it on 1x. Awesome shot! On this site and that one.', '2011-01-02 20:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267947, 924307, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is really well done.   I''m usually not a fan of heavy processing but you''ve succeeded in turning a simple subject into something magical.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is really well done.   I''m usually not a fan of heavy processing but you''ve succeeded in turning a simple subject into something magical.  Good luck!', '2011-01-02 20:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267951, 924940, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective that works on many levels.  Nice to see a different take on a pet photo.</td>', 'Interesting perspective that works on many levels.  Nice to see a different take on a pet photo.', '2011-01-02 20:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267955, 927163, 75618, '<td valign="top">Nice processing, hope it was done within the rules of the challenge. 7</td>', 'Nice processing, hope it was done within the rules of the challenge. 7', '2011-01-02 20:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267987, 927108, 99120, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image is fantastic. Composition, colouring, subject matter. 10</td>', 'Everything about this image is fantastic. Composition, colouring, subject matter. 10', '2011-01-02 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267988, 926868, 99120, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The colour is fantastic and enhances this scene to magical status. 10</td>', 'Beautiful image. The colour is fantastic and enhances this scene to magical status. 10', '2011-01-02 21:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267990, 927322, 99120, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and black and white treatment. 10</td>', 'Love the composition and black and white treatment. 10', '2011-01-02 21:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267993, 926854, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of composition here, is distinct elements and natural flow.</td>', 'I like your choice of composition here, is distinct elements and natural flow.', '2011-01-02 21:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267995, 926270, 99120, '<td valign="top">This image tells a great story. Well done. 10</td>', 'This image tells a great story. Well done. 10', '2011-01-02 21:19:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6267996, 927292, 99120, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the subject matter. It elevates it above ''just another bird shot''. 10</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the subject matter. It elevates it above ''just another bird shot''. 10', '2011-01-02 21:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267997, 926244, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details in this shot. I really enjoy the color cast you chose.</td>', 'Great details in this shot. I really enjoy the color cast you chose.', '2011-01-02 21:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267998, 926962, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very precious photo. I not caring for the heavy vignette used.</td>', 'Very precious photo. I not caring for the heavy vignette used.', '2011-01-02 21:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6267999, 927304, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice job leading our eyes through the photo with the train tracks.</td>', 'Really nice job leading our eyes through the photo with the train tracks.', '2011-01-02 21:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268001, 927412, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a background flower to add extra context to this photo.</td>', 'Nice use of a background flower to add extra context to this photo.', '2011-01-02 21:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268004, 927128, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good details, and good colors in the head. I''m not sure how I feel about all the black and dark shadows, I think the bird blends in a bit too much.</td>', 'Good details, and good colors in the head. I''m not sure how I feel about all the black and dark shadows, I think the bird blends in a bit too much.', '2011-01-02 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268005, 926698, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing a piece of history in this photo.</td>', 'Nice job capturing a piece of history in this photo.', '2011-01-02 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268006, 926468, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the though here. I wish there was more visible detail in the bottom half of the photo.</td>', 'I like the though here. I wish there was more visible detail in the bottom half of the photo.', '2011-01-02 21:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268007, 927322, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage point for this photo.</td>', 'Nice vantage point for this photo.', '2011-01-02 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268008, 927282, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of repeating elements and depth.</td>', 'Good use of repeating elements and depth.', '2011-01-02 21:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268009, 926608, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job inducing a feeling of vertigo with this.</td>', 'Great job inducing a feeling of vertigo with this.', '2011-01-02 21:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268010, 927329, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene with good details and colors. The scattering of boats really adds interest.</td>', 'Very nice scene with good details and colors. The scattering of boats really adds interest.', '2011-01-02 21:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268011, 927453, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, especially against the background. Nice use of diagonal lines.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, especially against the background. Nice use of diagonal lines.', '2011-01-02 21:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268012, 927357, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool find. I like how the rust from the cars on top is dripping down the roof of the bus.</td>', 'Cool find. I like how the rust from the cars on top is dripping down the roof of the bus.', '2011-01-02 21:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268013, 927069, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool vantage point in this photo, and nice find overall.</td>', 'Cool vantage point in this photo, and nice find overall.', '2011-01-02 21:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268014, 927053, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how you have layers in this photo via depth of field.</td>', 'I like how you have layers in this photo via depth of field.', '2011-01-02 21:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268015, 927019, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the plain and simple feel to this photo.</td>', 'I like the plain and simple feel to this photo.', '2011-01-02 21:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268016, 926860, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice touch of color in an otherwise drab scene.</td>', 'Nice touch of color in an otherwise drab scene.', '2011-01-02 21:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268017, 924530, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good find. That piece of cloth really tells a story.</td>', 'Good find. That piece of cloth really tells a story.', '2011-01-02 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268018, 927492, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the details in this photo. IS it just me, or do the sheep look kind of green?</td>', 'Nice job with the details in this photo. IS it just me, or do the sheep look kind of green?', '2011-01-02 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268020, 926850, 114225, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like the blurry person photos at all, but here I think it works alright. I like how you setup a sense of scale in this photo.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like the blurry person photos at all, but here I think it works alright. I like how you setup a sense of scale in this photo.', '2011-01-02 21:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268021, 926761, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture here. Nice details in the sky and nice crisp silhouette.</td>', 'Very cool capture here. Nice details in the sky and nice crisp silhouette.', '2011-01-02 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268022, 925740, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. It''s interesting how the water under the bridge is still open. I feel like this could be even better with a little higher contrast; I''m not finding the deep blacks that I want here.</td>', 'Nice scene. It''s interesting how the water under the bridge is still open. I feel like this could be even better with a little higher contrast; I''m not finding the deep blacks that I want here.', '2011-01-02 21:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268023, 927110, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I can only imagine the story behind this shot.</td>', 'Very cool. I can only imagine the story behind this shot.', '2011-01-02 21:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268025, 927338, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice emotion in this portrait. Interesting choice using the letterbox border on a photo like this. I''m not caring for it, but I''m not bringing the vote down because of it.</td>', 'Nice emotion in this portrait. Interesting choice using the letterbox border on a photo like this. I''m not caring for it, but I''m not bringing the vote down because of it.', '2011-01-02 21:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268026, 927475, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colors and feel to this photo.</td>', 'Nice warm colors and feel to this photo.', '2011-01-02 21:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268027, 926425, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is such a dynamic image. Feels like the clouds are going to burst.</td>', 'Wow, this is such a dynamic image. Feels like the clouds are going to burst.', '2011-01-02 21:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268028, 927215, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very sweet image. I like the soft colors and the composition you chose.</td>', 'Very sweet image. I like the soft colors and the composition you chose.', '2011-01-02 21:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268030, 927203, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. I like how you cropped this tightly to make the viewer feel like this effect extends forever in all directions.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. I like how you cropped this tightly to make the viewer feel like this effect extends forever in all directions.', '2011-01-02 21:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268033, 926294, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool scene, and great use of objects at all different depths.</td>', 'Cool scene, and great use of objects at all different depths.', '2011-01-02 21:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268034, 926979, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Defiance in the face of big red text.</td>', 'I like this. Defiance in the face of big red text.', '2011-01-02 21:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268035, 927348, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing colors to this photo. The sky feels so creamy.</td>', 'Very pleasing colors to this photo. The sky feels so creamy.', '2011-01-02 21:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268039, 926712, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details in the bird. I like how the shape of it kind of makes a triangle.</td>', 'Great details in the bird. I like how the shape of it kind of makes a triangle.', '2011-01-02 21:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268040, 927065, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool dam. I find myself wanting to see a bit more outside of the dam, particularly in the left half of the photo.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool dam. I find myself wanting to see a bit more outside of the dam, particularly in the left half of the photo.', '2011-01-02 21:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268041, 926442, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing the scene. I like how the diagonal lines create a sense of movement.</td>', 'Nice job capturing the scene. I like how the diagonal lines create a sense of movement.', '2011-01-02 21:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268042, 927371, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool scene. The fog really helps create aerial perspective.</td>', 'Cool scene. The fog really helps create aerial perspective.', '2011-01-02 21:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268044, 927238, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. It''s simple, yet effective in portraying the subject. I also enjoy your processing.</td>', 'I like this. It''s simple, yet effective in portraying the subject. I also enjoy your processing.', '2011-01-02 21:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268045, 925348, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty cool view for a front yard, I''m jealous. The swing in there is doing two things for me. First, it adds interest and context. But it''s also somehow disrupting the harmony of the trees.</td>', 'That''s a pretty cool view for a front yard, I''m jealous. The swing in there is doing two things for me. First, it adds interest and context. But it''s also somehow disrupting the harmony of the trees.', '2011-01-02 21:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268046, 925634, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the sky, and nice even layout. However, the buildings feel washed out, like the shadows have been brought up to bring out detail that likely isn''t there.<br/> <br/>Edited for spelling mistake<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-09 14:28:37.</i></td>', 'Nice colors in the sky, and nice even layout. However, the buildings feel washed out, like the shadows have been brought up to bring out detail that likely isn''t there. Edited for spelling mistake', '2011-01-02 21:39:30.000000', '2011-01-09 14:28:37.000000', 1),
(6268047, 927100, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good composition. the use of complimentary colors and diagonal lines draws attention.</td>', 'Good composition. the use of complimentary colors and diagonal lines draws attention.', '2011-01-02 21:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268048, 926659, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a cute squirrel portrat. The mixture of browns, while basic, really works for this.</td>', 'That''s a cute squirrel portrat. The mixture of browns, while basic, really works for this.', '2011-01-02 21:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268049, 927106, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a technically nice shot, with good details and a touch of color. But I don''t find a ton of interest in it.</td>', 'This is a technically nice shot, with good details and a touch of color. But I don''t find a ton of interest in it.', '2011-01-02 21:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268051, 927487, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. There is a s smooth, inviting feel to this scene. I just wish the background were a little more obscured to draw out your subject more.</td>', 'Nice portrait. There is a s smooth, inviting feel to this scene. I just wish the background were a little more obscured to draw out your subject more.', '2011-01-02 21:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268053, 927140, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting effect. I''m not sure if I like it or not. I do like how it draws attention to the flowers, but I don''t really like the shadows in the stems/leaves.</td>', 'Interesting lighting effect. I''m not sure if I like it or not. I do like how it draws attention to the flowers, but I don''t really like the shadows in the stems/leaves.', '2011-01-02 21:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268054, 927360, 114225, '<td valign="top">Haha, love the face. Nice job giving the horse room to walk into the photo.</td>', 'Haha, love the face. Nice job giving the horse room to walk into the photo.', '2011-01-02 21:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
