(6268584, 927375, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This image does manage to intrigue - both from a technical and content perspective. Technically, the double-exposed appearance and the soft colours work really well.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Compositionally, this doesn''t quite work for me, the image seems a little out of kilter - I don''t know why, I''ve tried different crops (with my hands) and your composition looks better than anything I can simulate.<br/> <br/>Overall: A lot going for it but in the final analysis there is something that just doesn''t click for me.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This image does manage to intrigue - both from a technical and content perspective. Technically, the double-exposed appearance and the soft colours work really well. Critical stuff: Compositionally, this doesn''t quite work for me, the image seems a little out of kilter - I don''t know why, I''ve tried different crops (with my hands) and your composition looks better than anything I can simulate. Overall: A lot going for it but in the final analysis there is something that just doesn''t click for me.', '2011-01-03 06:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268590, 927496, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a grower! Bumped it a couple of times now. The ''through mesh'' appearance is effective and gives a slightly furtive look that I am always fond of. Despite the low contrast, I like how the crusty texture of the bread is still well communicated. I also like the restraint in relation to the light here. I''m a fan of the vignette too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I think there is only so far you can go with an image like this - in the end, you can only wring out some much interest.<br/> <br/>Overall: A shot that I have come to like after a few viewings - perhaps a problem when there are as many images as there are in a FS to get through.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a grower! Bumped it a couple of times now. The ''through mesh'' appearance is effective and gives a slightly furtive look that I am always fond of. Despite the low contrast, I like how the crusty texture of the bread is still well communicated. I also like the restraint in relation to the light here. I''m a fan of the vignette too. Critical stuff: I think there is only so far you can go with an image like this - in the end, you can only wring out some much interest. Overall: A shot that I have come to like after a few viewings - perhaps a problem when there are as many images as there are in a FS to get through.', '2011-01-03 06:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268601, 927010, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Very nice story here and I am a fan of the high contrast - personally I think the blown highlights work really well.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: There seems to be some ''Topaz''-like smoothing going on - most prominent on her top and his trousers; I must admit to finding the effect distracting.<br/> <br/>Overall: An engaging image, but one that (for me) has a couple of niggles.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Very nice story here and I am a fan of the high contrast - personally I think the blown highlights work really well. Critical stuff: There seems to be some ''Topaz''-like smoothing going on - most prominent on her top and his trousers; I must admit to finding the effect distracting. Overall: An engaging image, but one that (for me) has a couple of niggles.', '2011-01-03 06:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268612, 926720, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the quirkiness of this shot - the POV and the scene. I particularly like the feet at the bottom of the frame. I also like the general, everyday domestic feel of the image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I feel the edit is a bit vanilla and you could have gone a lot bolder - particularly in a way that would pull out the fantastic shadow on the oven door.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very engaging image but one that (for me) feels a little sub-optimal in terms of its edit.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like the quirkiness of this shot - the POV and the scene. I particularly like the feet at the bottom of the frame. I also like the general, everyday domestic feel of the image. Critical stuff: I feel the edit is a bit vanilla and you could have gone a lot bolder - particularly in a way that would pull out the fantastic shadow on the oven door. Overall: A very engaging image but one that (for me) feels a little sub-optimal in terms of its edit.', '2011-01-03 07:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268616, 926738, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is rather beautifully done. It may look snap-shottish at first glance but get past that and we have something that is well composed, has great coloration and is fun to boot.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much, perhaps a tad more highlight recovery might have been welcomed.<br/> <br/>Overall: I think you have captured a moment here... and a ''feel-good'' one at that. Giving this a significant bump from my first viewing.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is rather beautifully done. It may look snap-shottish at first glance but get past that and we have something that is well composed, has great coloration and is fun to boot. Critical stuff: Not much, perhaps a tad more highlight recovery might have been welcomed. Overall: I think you have captured a moment here... and a ''feel-good'' one at that. Giving this a significant bump from my first viewing.', '2011-01-03 07:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268628, 924568, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like the idea behind this shot - the glowing lights, the bustling scene. I like how you have deviated from straight monochrome too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: This is the sort of shot I would normally like but there are a few elements that conspire to detract from it''s overall feel:<br/> <br/>1. We are distant from the scene, although I''m a fan of negative space the emptiness of the lower frame here is not quite empty enough to merely act as a guide for the eye and as a consequence frustrates rather than delights. We remain remote and uninvolved.<br/> <br/>2. The overall sharpness - it just doesn''t have enough clarity to communicate the scene well; I remember the street signs picture that ribboned a few weeks back, the clarity in that shot was astounding and contributed much. You could do with some of that magic here.<br/> <br/>3. Coloration- I appreciate the slight bluish hue but I think you could push it further. Checkout JimiRose''s 8+ scoring image of Rome just to see how well blue coloration can work on a might time city street scene.<br/> <br/>Overall, this image demonstrates a good eye but (for me) needs a bit more finesse to do well.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like the idea behind this shot - the glowing lights, the bustling scene. I like how you have deviated from straight monochrome too. Critical stuff: This is the sort of shot I would normally like but there are a few elements that conspire to detract from it''s overall feel: 1. We are distant from the scene, although I''m a fan of negative space the emptiness of the lower frame here is not quite empty enough to merely act as a guide for the eye and as a consequence frustrates rather than delights. We remain remote and uninvolved. 2. The overall sharpness - it just doesn''t have enough clarity to communicate the scene well; I remember the street signs picture that ribboned a few weeks back, the clarity in that shot was astounding and contributed much. You could do with some of that magic here. 3. Coloration- I appreciate the slight bluish hue but I think you could push it further. Checkout JimiRose''s 8+ scoring image of Rome just to see how well blue coloration can work on a might time city street scene. Overall, this image demonstrates a good eye but (for me) needs a bit more finesse to do well.', '2011-01-03 07:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268631, 927374, 113156, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, but the whole photo is overexposed, nice try though and a lovely tree it is.</td>', 'The composition is good, but the whole photo is overexposed, nice try though and a lovely tree it is.', '2011-01-03 08:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268632, 926698, 113156, '<td valign="top">Lovely B&amp;W and a good title all help me give you a good score.</td>', 'Lovely B&W and a good title all help me give you a good score.', '2011-01-03 08:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268633, 926979, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: The juxtaposition of the sign and the legs makes for a great visual gag - it makes me wonder whether the sign is there for safety reasons. The overall composition is very sound and I like the way the red writing contrasts with the blue sea - reason enough not to take this monochrome.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The dark blue haloing around the legs - I think you could have cleaned up that part of the image by tweaking that a little.<br/> <br/>Overall: An interesting shot with enough story to make me smile.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: The juxtaposition of the sign and the legs makes for a great visual gag - it makes me wonder whether the sign is there for safety reasons. The overall composition is very sound and I like the way the red writing contrasts with the blue sea - reason enough not to take this monochrome. Critical stuff: The dark blue haloing around the legs - I think you could have cleaned up that part of the image by tweaking that a little. Overall: An interesting shot with enough story to make me smile.', '2011-01-03 08:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268640, 927494, 100393, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the circle in the Tiger''s left eye. Looking at the right (our left) I think you may have cloned across.</td>', 'I don''t really understand the circle in the Tiger''s left eye. Looking at the right (our left) I think you may have cloned across.', '2011-01-03 08:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268643, 927410, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the POV and the background colours in this shot - for some reason it looks too chilly to take a seat though! The focus on the chair with the wide open aperture works really well  - the bokeh of the tree lights is a stand out feature.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The verticals.... I really want to straighten this up.<br/> <br/>Overall: A nice image but one that (for me) falls short of having wow factor.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like the POV and the background colours in this shot - for some reason it looks too chilly to take a seat though! The focus on the chair with the wide open aperture works really well  - the bokeh of the tree lights is a stand out feature. Critical stuff: The verticals.... I really want to straighten this up. Overall: A nice image but one that (for me) falls short of having wow factor.', '2011-01-03 08:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268645, 926241, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lucky you to see an illusive animal. I imagine he was tricky to photograph, running about the bush. Nice job getting the head sharp with everything else moving.</td>', 'Lucky you to see an illusive animal. I imagine he was tricky to photograph, running about the bush. Nice job getting the head sharp with everything else moving.', '2011-01-03 08:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268646, 923417, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this scene overall. The person adds a lot of interest, and the grass blowing adds movement. But I''m not in love with the sky. Parts near the tree are nice and blue, but the rest is bright white, it''s unappealing to me.</td>', 'I like this scene overall. The person adds a lot of interest, and the grass blowing adds movement. But I''m not in love with the sky. Parts near the tree are nice and blue, but the rest is bright white, it''s unappealing to me.', '2011-01-03 08:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268647, 926547, 114225, '<td valign="top">Some interesting ruins here.I like how you filled the frame with your subjects.</td>', 'Some interesting ruins here.I like how you filled the frame with your subjects.', '2011-01-03 08:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268648, 927086, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the color in the barn and tractor really pop out agains the white snow.</td>', 'I like how the color in the barn and tractor really pop out agains the white snow.', '2011-01-03 08:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268649, 927310, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors in this photo, and your composition is very nice. The eye starts at the light house, and is brought through the rest of the photo naturally.</td>', 'Wonderful colors in this photo, and your composition is very nice. The eye starts at the light house, and is brought through the rest of the photo naturally.', '2011-01-03 08:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268650, 924390, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details and colors in this shot. I really like how the sky has a hint of clouds, that breaks up the background without being distracting.</td>', 'Great details and colors in this shot. I really like how the sky has a hint of clouds, that breaks up the background without being distracting.', '2011-01-03 08:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268652, 927380, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like how candid this image is, I could believe you were invisible. I like the high contrast treatment too. I particularly like the pipework to his left.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The strange smoothness of the fabrics - looks like something you might get with Topaz. I''m afraid I''m not a fan of that look (though I do confess to having used it myself before.)<br/> <br/>Overall: A very good candid capture.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like how candid this image is, I could believe you were invisible. I like the high contrast treatment too. I particularly like the pipework to his left. Critical stuff: The strange smoothness of the fabrics - looks like something you might get with Topaz. I''m afraid I''m not a fan of that look (though I do confess to having used it myself before.) Overall: A very good candid capture.', '2011-01-03 08:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268653, 924568, 114225, '<td valign="top">A nice night city scene, captured with low noise and good details. But I''m not finding any interesting subject matter in it.</td>', 'A nice night city scene, captured with low noise and good details. But I''m not finding any interesting subject matter in it.', '2011-01-03 08:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268654, 926630, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the details in the grains, but this very high key look isn''t working for me.</td>', 'I like the details in the grains, but this very high key look isn''t working for me.', '2011-01-03 08:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268655, 927499, 114225, '<td valign="top">A  nice view of the past. I like how the sun bursts in the rim.</td>', 'A  nice view of the past. I like how the sun bursts in the rim.', '2011-01-03 08:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268656, 927234, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job using a hair light, and very nice softness of the light throughout. To me, it looks like you may have used some skin softening on the face. But there are still details in the lips and neck, which gives it an un-natual feel to me. My apologies if I''m seeing this wrong.</td>', 'Nice job using a hair light, and very nice softness of the light throughout. To me, it looks like you may have used some skin softening on the face. But there are still details in the lips and neck, which gives it an un-natual feel to me. My apologies if I''m seeing this wrong.', '2011-01-03 08:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268657, 927452, 114225, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, and I like how there are visible clouds in the sky. The focus feels just a bit soft to me. Actually, it looks like maybe focus was ok, but maybe the lens fogged up??</td>', 'A nice scene, and I like how there are visible clouds in the sky. The focus feels just a bit soft to me. Actually, it looks like maybe focus was ok, but maybe the lens fogged up??', '2011-01-03 08:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268658, 927496, 114225, '<td valign="top">That looks like it will be good. I''m not sure about the black and white here. I really find myself wanting to see this in color.</td>', 'That looks like it will be good. I''m not sure about the black and white here. I really find myself wanting to see this in color.', '2011-01-03 08:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268659, 923435, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice full frame composition and good patterns in the wings. Feels just a bit soft to me, like some heavy noise reduction was applied, perhaps?</td>', 'Nice full frame composition and good patterns in the wings. Feels just a bit soft to me, like some heavy noise reduction was applied, perhaps?', '2011-01-03 08:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268660, 926698, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a much stronger image than my first quick look through revealed - the interplay between the two orthogonal window frames is excellent - frames within frames within frames. It offers a wonderful sense of perspective.<br/> <br/>The ''KTK'' lettering in the middle jumps right out at you and the light, as it hits the residual glass, is lovely.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overal:: An image I''ve really gotten to like - a significant bump from 6 to 8.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a much stronger image than my first quick look through revealed - the interplay between the two orthogonal window frames is excellent - frames within frames within frames. It offers a wonderful sense of perspective. The ''KTK'' lettering in the middle jumps right out at you and the light, as it hits the residual glass, is lovely. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overal:: An image I''ve really gotten to like - a significant bump from 6 to 8.', '2011-01-03 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268661, 926430, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of vanishing point to make this bridge seems like it extends forever. I also like the reflection off his helmet.</td>', 'Nice use of vanishing point to make this bridge seems like it extends forever. I also like the reflection off his helmet.', '2011-01-03 08:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268662, 927477, 114225, '<td valign="top">A nice, but basic portrait.  Good soft and even lighting. Those tiles are really distracting me somehow.</td>', 'A nice, but basic portrait.  Good soft and even lighting. Those tiles are really distracting me somehow.', '2011-01-03 08:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268663, 926949, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great colors here, that puprple really stands out.</td>', 'Great colors here, that puprple really stands out.', '2011-01-03 08:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268665, 927091, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting setup.First time I looked at this, I didn''t see the people on the sides at all. I don''t know how much you could have setup, or if you even have this but I think this would have been a great opportunity for a bounce flash. It could bring out some of those side details without looking the deep orange table.</td>', 'Interesting setup.First time I looked at this, I didn''t see the people on the sides at all. I don''t know how much you could have setup, or if you even have this but I think this would have been a great opportunity for a bounce flash. It could bring out some of those side details without looking the deep orange table.', '2011-01-03 08:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268666, 927439, 114225, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective, and good details. I''m personally not finding the image super interesting.</td>', 'Neat perspective, and good details. I''m personally not finding the image super interesting.', '2011-01-03 08:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268667, 927055, 114225, '<td valign="top">This seems like a snapshot, but a good one. The contrast of their orange clothing versus all the darks and greens is very nice.</td>', 'This seems like a snapshot, but a good one. The contrast of their orange clothing versus all the darks and greens is very nice.', '2011-01-03 08:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268668, 927148, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: There are a lot of ways to shoot and present a beach but not everybody would be as brave as this. I like that. Wow, does this image show up marks on screens - I''ve had to float this around until I''ve found an area that doesn''t make it look like you need to clean your sensor. Once I did, the image really sings - smooth but sharp, still but dynamic. Excellent.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Beautifully subtle image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: There are a lot of ways to shoot and present a beach but not everybody would be as brave as this. I like that. Wow, does this image show up marks on screens - I''ve had to float this around until I''ve found an area that doesn''t make it look like you need to clean your sensor. Once I did, the image really sings - smooth but sharp, still but dynamic. Excellent. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Beautifully subtle image.', '2011-01-03 08:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268669, 927201, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expansive landscape. Is that a city down in the valley?</td>', 'Beautiful expansive landscape. Is that a city down in the valley?', '2011-01-03 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268670, 927418, 100393, '<td valign="top">Highly journalistic. Indistinguishable from a news site image.<br/> <br/>Very well made (Judi??)<br/> <br/>On a non-photographic level, its horrific to think about the hardship associated with what we are seeing here.</td>', 'Highly journalistic. Indistinguishable from a news site image. Very well made (Judi??) On a non-photographic level, its horrific to think about the hardship associated with what we are seeing here.', '2011-01-03 08:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268671, 927035, 114225, '<td valign="top">I bet they don''t get used too much this time of year. Nice job using diagonal lines to add interest. I feel like something is a bit over-sharpened, the white specks in the bench feel a bit too white.</td>', 'I bet they don''t get used too much this time of year. Nice job using diagonal lines to add interest. I feel like something is a bit over-sharpened, the white specks in the bench feel a bit too white.', '2011-01-03 08:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268672, 927356, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good find for a repeating subject. Might I suggest you pull in for a closer look? As it stands, we can count how many hooks there are. But if you cropped tighter, we could imagine an entire wall filled with hooks.</td>', 'Good find for a repeating subject. Might I suggest you pull in for a closer look? As it stands, we can count how many hooks there are. But if you cropped tighter, we could imagine an entire wall filled with hooks.', '2011-01-03 08:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268673, 926859, 114225, '<td valign="top">A classic winter view. Looks like someone was walking through the snow at the top of your scene.</td>', 'A classic winter view. Looks like someone was walking through the snow at the top of your scene.', '2011-01-03 08:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268674, 926858, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great expression on this guy. I like the bokeh here, it adds a bit of context/interest.</td>', 'Great expression on this guy. I like the bokeh here, it adds a bit of context/interest.', '2011-01-03 08:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268675, 927403, 114225, '<td valign="top">Someone didn''t get what he wanted for Christmas :)<br/>Interesting lighting you have here, coming from the bottom left of the frame.</td>', 'Someone didn''t get what he wanted for Christmas :)Interesting lighting you have here, coming from the bottom left of the frame.', '2011-01-03 08:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268676, 927359, 114225, '<td valign="top">It looks terrified! Did a great white shark just appear? Nice details in the fur.</td>', 'It looks terrified! Did a great white shark just appear? Nice details in the fur.', '2011-01-03 08:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268677, 926720, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of a fish eye lens. The cat looks like he is having a great time.</td>', 'Interesting use of a fish eye lens. The cat looks like he is having a great time.', '2011-01-03 08:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268678, 926574, 114225, '<td valign="top">That is a menacing stare he has. I''m finding this picture feels very washed out. The blacks are grey, and the brights are dull.</td>', 'That is a menacing stare he has. I''m finding this picture feels very washed out. The blacks are grey, and the brights are dull.', '2011-01-03 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268679, 927148, 114225, '<td valign="top">This looks like it expands beyond the frame forever. I do wish there were some object of interest. Be it a stone, driftwood, or anything to keep my attention.</td>', 'This looks like it expands beyond the frame forever. I do wish there were some object of interest. Be it a stone, driftwood, or anything to keep my attention.', '2011-01-03 08:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268680, 927381, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job making this hall look like it extends a very long way. I''m not too keen on the off centered composition. This type of architecture calls for perfect balance.</td>', 'Nice job making this hall look like it extends a very long way. I''m not too keen on the off centered composition. This type of architecture calls for perfect balance.', '2011-01-03 08:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268682, 924482, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting the details in there. I wonder what it would look like even closer up, maybe we could see some of the individual flakes if you got close enough.</td>', 'Nice job getting the details in there. I wonder what it would look like even closer up, maybe we could see some of the individual flakes if you got close enough.', '2011-01-03 08:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268683, 927296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, graffiti rarely interests me, and photos of graffiti even less so. You have to make it interesting somehow, by maybe including a painter in action or someone getting busted by the cops.</td>', 'Unfortunately, graffiti rarely interests me, and photos of graffiti even less so. You have to make it interesting somehow, by maybe including a painter in action or someone getting busted by the cops.', '2011-01-03 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268688, 926442, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: OK, this is lovely, a very cute image with great story. There are a number of stand-out elements in the image - the Macy''s sign, the newspaper, the reflected figure above it, the tree with its star...<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I''ve probably underscored it a little at a six but I am between a 6 and a 7. Reasons for not bumping to a 7:<br/> <br/>For me, it lacks a little punch - I think this is down to the contrast profile, i wonder if brighter whites (shifted levels) would help. I''m a fan of grain and I''d add some, though I know that isn''t everybody''s cup of tea.<br/> <br/>Those stand out compositional elements mentioned above are, I think, undersold - some curves manipulation or other technique to make these features more prominent might make a real difference.<br/> <br/>I suppose what Im saying is that perhaps you have been too subtle with the image - you''ve concentrated on the child but for me the really interesting elements are in the top half of the image.<br/> <br/>Overall: I think this is a great capture with a suboptimal edit (at least for the FS... for Outside looking In your emphasis is perfect)</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: OK, this is lovely, a very cute image with great story. There are a number of stand-out elements in the image - the Macy''s sign, the newspaper, the reflected figure above it, the tree with its star... Critical stuff: I''ve probably underscored it a little at a six but I am between a 6 and a 7. Reasons for not bumping to a 7: For me, it lacks a little punch - I think this is down to the contrast profile, i wonder if brighter whites (shifted levels) would help. I''m a fan of grain and I''d add some, though I know that isn''t everybody''s cup of tea. Those stand out compositional elements mentioned above are, I think, undersold - some curves manipulation or other technique to make these features more prominent might make a real difference. I suppose what Im saying is that perhaps you have been too subtle with the image - you''ve concentrated on the child but for me the really interesting elements are in the top half of the image. Overall: I think this is a great capture with a suboptimal edit (at least for the FS... for Outside looking In your emphasis is perfect)', '2011-01-03 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268693, 926425, 100393, '<td valign="top">Landscapes normally leave me a little cold but this one is just soooo well done. I''d be astonished if this didn''t ribbon.</td>', 'Landscapes normally leave me a little cold but this one is just soooo well done. I''d be astonished if this didn''t ribbon.', '2011-01-03 09:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268696, 927127, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Immediately makes me think <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=7778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">zeuszen</a> or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">clive_patric_nolan</a>. If I had to bet on just one I''d go for the former. I like the mystery of this image - because we can''t discern what it is we can''t help but focus on the pure form and the light. I really like the toning and coloration too - perfect for this shot.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The slightly ''cruddy'' pixelated background - it pulls may away from the banded edge of the vessel(?).<br/> <br/>Overall: Not for everyone and I do find these sorts of images tend to constrain rather than liberate my eye and brain but having said that, this is certainly very well made.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Immediately makes me think  zeuszen or  clive_patric_nolan. If I had to bet on just one I''d go for the former. I like the mystery of this image - because we can''t discern what it is we can''t help but focus on the pure form and the light. I really like the toning and coloration too - perfect for this shot. Critical stuff: The slightly ''cruddy'' pixelated background - it pulls may away from the banded edge of the vessel(?). Overall: Not for everyone and I do find these sorts of images tend to constrain rather than liberate my eye and brain but having said that, this is certainly very well made.', '2011-01-03 09:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268740, 924892, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.', '2011-01-03 10:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
