(6268768, 927121, 86218, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit dark in the bottom part for my taste. I would have cropped the total black section out. I do like the railing and slight hint of detail in the black parts where is does appear. Soft focus on light window works</td>', 'Image is a bit dark in the bottom part for my taste. I would have cropped the total black section out. I do like the railing and slight hint of detail in the black parts where is does appear. Soft focus on light window works', '2011-01-03 10:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268771, 925985, 86218, '<td valign="top">Nice pic - Image looks a bit soft on the teeth and not sure if focus was right as the hood seems pretty sharp.</td>', 'Nice pic - Image looks a bit soft on the teeth and not sure if focus was right as the hood seems pretty sharp.', '2011-01-03 10:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268775, 927294, 86218, '<td valign="top">Really a nice pic and such a pity focusing is on the wrong spot. Im no bird photographer myself but know how difficult this can be as I have tried :(. The twig in the fore is also a bit distracting. Keep at it</td>', 'Really a nice pic and such a pity focusing is on the wrong spot. Im no bird photographer myself but know how difficult this can be as I have tried :(. The twig in the fore is also a bit distracting. Keep at it', '2011-01-03 10:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268778, 927292, 86218, '<td valign="top">Art. Super image and I love this gazillions 9</td>', 'Art. Super image and I love this gazillions 9', '2011-01-03 10:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268780, 926735, 56502, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait!</td>', 'Very nice portrait!', '2011-01-03 10:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268781, 927241, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK - I''m going out on a limb here and letting you know that I scored this a ''1''. Only fair to let you know why.<br/> <br/>First of all I should say that I use the full scale and that I am but one voter with my own expectations and ''luggage''.<br/> <br/>The subject matter is one that really doesn''t excite me (it will be on the money for plenty of other people though).<br/> <br/>Although I think the upward looking POV is interesting enough, the bottom right rock formation encroaches on the area of interest and detracts from the scene.<br/> <br/>Most of all though, I''m afraid I''ve against your editing choices - the blown highlights and blue fringing to the water are to my eye very unattractive.<br/> <br/>Having said all of that and having spent the time writing this comment I do wonder if a 1 is a bit harsh.... Bumping to a 2.</td>', 'OK - I''m going out on a limb here and letting you know that I scored this a ''1''. Only fair to let you know why. First of all I should say that I use the full scale and that I am but one voter with my own expectations and ''luggage''. The subject matter is one that really doesn''t excite me (it will be on the money for plenty of other people though). Although I think the upward looking POV is interesting enough, the bottom right rock formation encroaches on the area of interest and detracts from the scene. Most of all though, I''m afraid I''ve against your editing choices - the blown highlights and blue fringing to the water are to my eye very unattractive. Having said all of that and having spent the time writing this comment I do wonder if a 1 is a bit harsh.... Bumping to a 2.', '2011-01-03 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268789, 926761, 92577, '<td valign="top">you just had to go one better!<br/>great shot - good luck</td>', 'you just had to go one better!great shot - good luck', '2011-01-03 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268796, 927337, 92577, '<td valign="top">colours and textures are wonderful - apart from the blurry splodge in the foreground =¬/<br/>good luck just the same</td>', 'colours and textures are wonderful - apart from the blurry splodge in the foreground =¬/good luck just the same', '2011-01-03 10:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268797, 924125, 92577, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2011-01-03 10:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268801, 927115, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK - I''m going out on a limb here and letting you know that I scored this a ''1''. Only fair to let you know why.<br/> <br/>First of all I should say that I use the full scale and that I am but one voter with my own expectations and ''luggage''.<br/> <br/>I should say I have a (fairly extreme) prejudice for images of ornaments - particularly figurines, so this was always going to be a hard sell to me. <br/> <br/>Of all the things you could photograph for a Free Study I''m not sure why you would choose something like this...<br/> <br/>Having said all that, it does have redeeming features - technically, it is a pretty pristine image and I can certainly respect that. Enough that I should bump it a little.... Bumping to a 2 for the technicals - I can''t bring myself to bump it any more, the image itself leaves me too cold. Apologies.</td>', 'OK - I''m going out on a limb here and letting you know that I scored this a ''1''. Only fair to let you know why. First of all I should say that I use the full scale and that I am but one voter with my own expectations and ''luggage''. I should say I have a (fairly extreme) prejudice for images of ornaments - particularly figurines, so this was always going to be a hard sell to me.  Of all the things you could photograph for a Free Study I''m not sure why you would choose something like this... Having said all that, it does have redeeming features - technically, it is a pretty pristine image and I can certainly respect that. Enough that I should bump it a little.... Bumping to a 2 for the technicals - I can''t bring myself to bump it any more, the image itself leaves me too cold. Apologies.', '2011-01-03 11:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
