(6268858, 926270, 12405, '<td valign="top">If he''s coming home, he forgot to tell someone. Coming home to no reception is very lonely thing. I believe that is what was captured here as he is by himself, and in the nasty cold weather, wishing for a warm friendly face and a warm car.</td>', 'If he''s coming home, he forgot to tell someone. Coming home to no reception is very lonely thing. I believe that is what was captured here as he is by himself, and in the nasty cold weather, wishing for a warm friendly face and a warm car.', '2011-01-03 11:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268859, 926833, 12405, '<td valign="top">I''m sucker for worn out old fences in the middle of no where, as I spend a lot of time in the desert, it''s always interesting to come across such a scene. The perspective on the fence then leads you to the 2 people walking on the road, which hints at a story which I also like. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I''m sucker for worn out old fences in the middle of no where, as I spend a lot of time in the desert, it''s always interesting to come across such a scene. The perspective on the fence then leads you to the 2 people walking on the road, which hints at a story which I also like. Thanks for sharing.', '2011-01-03 11:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6268860, 926865, 12405, '<td valign="top">very nice, and great detail in the eyes.</td>', 'very nice, and great detail in the eyes.', '2011-01-03 11:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
