(6268877, 926144, 12405, '<td valign="top">I''m wonder what this would look like in black and white. The reason I''m wondering is I almost feel like the red dress is taking away from her face, going black and white might help the distraction. Overall though well done, I like the framing that she is brighter and your drawn to her in the image, and the pose is good and like the lighting.</td>', 'I''m wonder what this would look like in black and white. The reason I''m wondering is I almost feel like the red dress is taking away from her face, going black and white might help the distraction. Overall though well done, I like the framing that she is brighter and your drawn to her in the image, and the pose is good and like the lighting.', '2011-01-03 11:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
