(6269148, 927410, 12405, '<td valign="top">I don''t often factor in a title, as this is to me more about the photo. Overall I see a empty chair with another one out of focus with the table caught behind.<br/> <br/>I''m not going to rate image on the title, just a thought I had. Overall I like the bokeh, and the mood of the overall photo. One of anticipation of the next visitor to take a seat, take in the lights and relax.<br/> <br/>The seat that is in focus and up front to me is the story and the focus. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I don''t often factor in a title, as this is to me more about the photo. Overall I see a empty chair with another one out of focus with the table caught behind. I''m not going to rate image on the title, just a thought I had. Overall I like the bokeh, and the mood of the overall photo. One of anticipation of the next visitor to take a seat, take in the lights and relax. The seat that is in focus and up front to me is the story and the focus. Thanks for sharing.', '2011-01-03 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
