(6269451, 927209, 69325, '<td valign="top">oh crap, there goes anyones chances for the blue ;)<br/>Had to come to this one, it''s one of those images that, while I am heartily tired of seeing hummingbirds I can''t NOT give it a 10! I am sure alot of people are tired of seeing my daughter in my shots but you go with what you''re good at yknow? Great capture on this and I am hoping you''ll post how you got the background like that, almost looks like you got them in your house.</td>', 'oh crap, there goes anyones chances for the blue ;)Had to come to this one, it''s one of those images that, while I am heartily tired of seeing hummingbirds I can''t NOT give it a 10! I am sure alot of people are tired of seeing my daughter in my shots but you go with what you''re good at yknow? Great capture on this and I am hoping you''ll post how you got the background like that, almost looks like you got them in your house.', '2011-01-03 19:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6269482, 926650, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful shot, and the processing in parts is wonderful, but the haloing around the mast and the bridge really detracts. If it''s topazed, you probably could have gotten away with masking out the sky, mast and bridge and not topazing that area, just using other adjustments there.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful shot, and the processing in parts is wonderful, but the haloing around the mast and the bridge really detracts. If it''s topazed, you probably could have gotten away with masking out the sky, mast and bridge and not topazing that area, just using other adjustments there.', '2011-01-03 19:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6269484, 927100, 12405, '<td valign="top">great detail and love the lighting, and the overall soft feeling when looking at this.</td>', 'great detail and love the lighting, and the overall soft feeling when looking at this.', '2011-01-03 19:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
