(6269496, 926979, 12405, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos you could change the tone of the photo with a different title, example suicidal or defiant both bring out different feelings and no change to the photo would be needed. making this a photo with endless possibilities. Though reckless is good, it''s not quite as emotionally impacting as another title would have been.<br/> <br/>Either way, fun photo as long as your model lived through the shot. Thanks for sharing.<br/> <br/>BTW I don''t rate on the title, it was just an observation and thought I had when I actually noticed the title.</td>', 'This is one of those photos you could change the tone of the photo with a different title, example suicidal or defiant both bring out different feelings and no change to the photo would be needed. making this a photo with endless possibilities. Though reckless is good, it''s not quite as emotionally impacting as another title would have been. Either way, fun photo as long as your model lived through the shot. Thanks for sharing. BTW I don''t rate on the title, it was just an observation and thought I had when I actually noticed the title.', '2011-01-03 19:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6269500, 926857, 12405, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this as the pose is overall good and the lighting, I always like a black and white portrait. The only thing is the face to me is emotionless. I''m not sure what the end goal was, but I would have like to see some kind of emotion.</td>', 'Overall I like this as the pose is overall good and the lighting, I always like a black and white portrait. The only thing is the face to me is emotionless. I''m not sure what the end goal was, but I would have like to see some kind of emotion.', '2011-01-03 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
