(6272578, 926698, 40391, '<td valign="top">Hehe, you really like that spot don''t you Spiffy.  This time framing the window framing the building works nicely.  Judging by the shadow on the window sill I''m guessing this was taken at the same time as the other with the lovely colours.  Was your choice to go b&amp;w a decision to differentiate from your other shot?  Im not sure if it really works here but that may be because I know the other shot.  Looking closer I feel youve done a good job of the conversions.  I especially like the effect on the broken glass.  Good luck.</td>', 'Hehe, you really like that spot don''t you Spiffy.  This time framing the window framing the building works nicely.  Judging by the shadow on the window sill I''m guessing this was taken at the same time as the other with the lovely colours.  Was your choice to go b&w a decision to differentiate from your other shot?  Im not sure if it really works here but that may be because I know the other shot.  Looking closer I feel youve done a good job of the conversions.  I especially like the effect on the broken glass.  Good luck.', '2011-01-05 19:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
