(6273471, 927276, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some good potential here, but there appears to be a bit of a tilt to this that would have been an easy fix. Horizon is possibly a little too centered in the vertical direction for my preferences.</td>', 'Some good potential here, but there appears to be a bit of a tilt to this that would have been an easy fix. Horizon is possibly a little too centered in the vertical direction for my preferences.', '2011-01-06 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273473, 927043, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hi, Cory. This place is starting to look familiar. Amazing how a long exposure makes night look like day. If not for the title and the stars in the sky, I wold have thought this to be late afternoon. How the heck does this body of water avoid drying up in this part of the country?</td>', 'Hi, Cory. This place is starting to look familiar. Amazing how a long exposure makes night look like day. If not for the title and the stars in the sky, I wold have thought this to be late afternoon. How the heck does this body of water avoid drying up in this part of the country?', '2011-01-06 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
