(6273579, 927388, 30364, '<td valign="top">So much I admire about this: the shapes, the tones, the ''natural'' layer effect, the harmony of the subject elements, the surprising sense of unity of the whole, and most of all your uncommon vision to see it and understand it.  Beautiful image and my top pick in the Free Study.  A rare pleasure.  Thank you.</td>', 'So much I admire about this: the shapes, the tones, the ''natural'' layer effect, the harmony of the subject elements, the surprising sense of unity of the whole, and most of all your uncommon vision to see it and understand it.  Beautiful image and my top pick in the Free Study.  A rare pleasure.  Thank you.', '2011-01-06 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
