(6274549, 927453, 76335, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you cranked up the saturation on the green or not. If not, then clearly Darwin''s not looking out for him.</td>', 'Don''t know if you cranked up the saturation on the green or not. If not, then clearly Darwin''s not looking out for him.', '2011-01-07 00:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
