(6274556, 924568, 76335, '<td valign="top">I initially was going to complain that there''s too little happening in the foreground and you should be closer. But on second thought, it offers an interesting contrast.</td>', 'I initially was going to complain that there''s too little happening in the foreground and you should be closer. But on second thought, it offers an interesting contrast.', '2011-01-07 00:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274582, 925836, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an unusual color.  And gotta love those freakishly large feet.  A touch melancholy.  I like it.</td>', 'What an unusual color.  And gotta love those freakishly large feet.  A touch melancholy.  I like it.', '2011-01-07 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
