(6274591, 926720, 30982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely delightful!  This is what those oddly shaped lenses were meant for.</td>', 'Absolutely delightful!  This is what those oddly shaped lenses were meant for.', '2011-01-07 00:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274604, 926860, 86218, '<td valign="top">As simple as this is it has a great feel to it. The pure white sky with the white foreground helps to make this building stand out perfectly (adding to the seperated allone feel) and the "barren trees" gives this a desolate feel yet security sugested within this "fortress" building that could give shelter. 9</td>', 'As simple as this is it has a great feel to it. The pure white sky with the white foreground helps to make this building stand out perfectly (adding to the seperated allone feel) and the "barren trees" gives this a desolate feel yet security sugested within this "fortress" building that could give shelter. 9', '2011-01-07 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274605, 923417, 86218, '<td valign="top">Slightly different comp would have made this work even better. The PP work lets this down a bit and I dont think it''s needed with this quality shot. Not shure what was done but it does look like you did pp on this? If Im wrong my apologies but the colours and textures on the scene as a whole does look odd and not natural which is important for this type of scene in my taste 7</td>', 'Slightly different comp would have made this work even better. The PP work lets this down a bit and I dont think it''s needed with this quality shot. Not shure what was done but it does look like you did pp on this? If Im wrong my apologies but the colours and textures on the scene as a whole does look odd and not natural which is important for this type of scene in my taste 7', '2011-01-07 01:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274606, 924050, 86218, '<td valign="top">Surreal feel to this and a great take. B&amp;W works on this. Would be tempted to work on the image and brighten up the rays of light in the water. Unusual image. 8</td>', 'Surreal feel to this and a great take. B&W works on this. Would be tempted to work on the image and brighten up the rays of light in the water. Unusual image. 8', '2011-01-07 01:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274607, 927061, 65438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2011-01-07 01:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274608, 927337, 86218, '<td valign="top">Beautifull light here and the comp works well leading into image. Foreground however is distracting here and blurred "nothing" should be cropped out. Just my 2c worth on it. Other might feel different? I would have gone closer to the edge and ad more depth to it that way. Always easy to comment like this when you havent been there yourself</td>', 'Beautifull light here and the comp works well leading into image. Foreground however is distracting here and blurred "nothing" should be cropped out. Just my 2c worth on it. Other might feel different? I would have gone closer to the edge and ad more depth to it that way. Always easy to comment like this when you havent been there yourself', '2011-01-07 01:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274614, 926738, 86218, '<td valign="top">This photographer is useless. Has he not discovered A.F. yet. The flash head is all wrong for correct bounce. It looks like he''s drinking a cup of tea with he''s pinkie up. Not proper control over focus ring and should it be the zoom he''s trying to do...goog luck. The complete grip lends itself to camera shake at low shutter speeds. <br/>Please contact RB photographers for an aprentice position...lol. Hope you understand this to be a joke based on the recent thread.<br/> <br/>Nice take and what makes this special is the faces in the background. Nice holiday spirit to this</td>', 'This photographer is useless. Has he not discovered A.F. yet. The flash head is all wrong for correct bounce. It looks like he''s drinking a cup of tea with he''s pinkie up. Not proper control over focus ring and should it be the zoom he''s trying to do...goog luck. The complete grip lends itself to camera shake at low shutter speeds. Please contact RB photographers for an aprentice position...lol. Hope you understand this to be a joke based on the recent thread. Nice take and what makes this special is the faces in the background. Nice holiday spirit to this', '2011-01-07 01:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274622, 927228, 86218, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. the only downside is to much black at the bottom halve. would def have zoomed in closer or have had a different crop to it. Mood is strong, colours and focus right. Subject caught at right moment and suspended fly feel enhanced by this. Exposure to good use for silouette.</td>', 'This is really nice. the only downside is to much black at the bottom halve. would def have zoomed in closer or have had a different crop to it. Mood is strong, colours and focus right. Subject caught at right moment and suspended fly feel enhanced by this. Exposure to good use for silouette.', '2011-01-07 02:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274626, 927453, 125605, '<td valign="top">This is really creepy...but I recognized this guy''s spots from my own pictures of the Nat Geo museum gecko exhibit...that <i>is</i> where you took this, right? What are the chances??</td>', 'This is really creepy...but I recognized this guy''s spots from my own pictures of the Nat Geo museum gecko exhibit...that is where you took this, right? What are the chances??', '2011-01-07 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274675, 927494, 31597, '<td valign="top">This looks like it was taken with a lower resolution camera. That being said the shot it really good, but I wish since this is an Advanced editing challenge that the editing was pushed more.</td>', 'This looks like it was taken with a lower resolution camera. That being said the shot it really good, but I wish since this is an Advanced editing challenge that the editing was pushed more.', '2011-01-07 06:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274677, 924050, 31597, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty awesome photo, but I really wish it was in color.</td>', 'This is a pretty awesome photo, but I really wish it was in color.', '2011-01-07 06:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274678, 927379, 31597, '<td valign="top">The soften effect totally ruined this photo for me. It totally takes away from the highlight of the photo, which is the incredible light on the red drapes.</td>', 'The soften effect totally ruined this photo for me. It totally takes away from the highlight of the photo, which is the incredible light on the red drapes.', '2011-01-07 06:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274680, 927082, 31597, '<td valign="top">While the image quality and subject is great, more of the story could be told if more of the subject could be seen.</td>', 'While the image quality and subject is great, more of the story could be told if more of the subject could be seen.', '2011-01-07 06:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274683, 927324, 31597, '<td valign="top">While I''m a sucker for a good texture shot, next time push the lighting and orientation a bit more. I think this would have been stronger vertically oriented. Also, using a higher aperture the make the shadows contrast more with the highlights. Remember this is white snow, so it looks like one big highlight.</td>', 'While I''m a sucker for a good texture shot, next time push the lighting and orientation a bit more. I think this would have been stronger vertically oriented. Also, using a higher aperture the make the shadows contrast more with the highlights. Remember this is white snow, so it looks like one big highlight.', '2011-01-07 06:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274685, 926854, 31597, '<td valign="top">Lighting, awesome.<br/>Subject, well posed.<br/>Only suggestion, get rid of the props in the window sill. Takes away from the guy''s face. Photo would seem less cluttered.</td>', 'Lighting, awesome.Subject, well posed.Only suggestion, get rid of the props in the window sill. Takes away from the guy''s face. Photo would seem less cluttered.', '2011-01-07 06:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274687, 927010, 31597, '<td valign="top">Looks way too much like a surveillance camera shot. Way too fuzzy, blacks are too black and nothing intersted about your subjects.</td>', 'Looks way too much like a surveillance camera shot. Way too fuzzy, blacks are too black and nothing intersted about your subjects.', '2011-01-07 06:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274688, 924791, 31597, '<td valign="top">I dig how there was some thought put into the blurs of this. Very fine art. Nice shot.</td>', 'I dig how there was some thought put into the blurs of this. Very fine art. Nice shot.', '2011-01-07 06:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274689, 927017, 31597, '<td valign="top">Push the vibrance of the color and I would have given it a higher score. -4</td>', 'Push the vibrance of the color and I would have given it a higher score. -4', '2011-01-07 06:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274692, 925836, 31597, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of editing, color and light! Totally a 10!</td>', 'Excellent use of editing, color and light! Totally a 10!', '2011-01-07 06:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274695, 926650, 30861, '<td valign="top">You''ve GOT to learn how to take care of the halos if you want to do this kind of processing; they are KILLING you here. You may PM me if you want help with it...</td>', 'You''ve GOT to learn how to take care of the halos if you want to do this kind of processing; they are KILLING you here. You may PM me if you want help with it...', '2011-01-07 07:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274719, 927121, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the geometry of this - I don''t know how else to say it; the relationship of the lines and planes to one another holds a lot of interest. We pass by such arrangements of lines and planes everyday without noticing this interplay and I like photographs that remind us to stop and look around once in a while.<br/> <br/>There is more to this image though - the way you offer up the light and shadow; the deep shadows, the blown highlights and the restraint of the greys - all very effective.<br/> <br/>My favourite part of the image is the streaking glow on the right hand window - its brightness contrasting with the general gloominess of the stairwell leaves us wondering what time of day it actually is.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Noting at all really.<br/> <br/>Overall: Nicely seen, nicely shot.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like the geometry of this - I don''t know how else to say it; the relationship of the lines and planes to one another holds a lot of interest. We pass by such arrangements of lines and planes everyday without noticing this interplay and I like photographs that remind us to stop and look around once in a while. There is more to this image though - the way you offer up the light and shadow; the deep shadows, the blown highlights and the restraint of the greys - all very effective. My favourite part of the image is the streaking glow on the right hand window - its brightness contrasting with the general gloominess of the stairwell leaves us wondering what time of day it actually is. Critical stuff: Noting at all really. Overall: Nicely seen, nicely shot.', '2011-01-07 07:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274720, 927245, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: The mast, the tree, the spire - all grounded but aspiring for the sky. Above, the bird, free and ungrounded, makes a wonderful connection between the domains of earth and sky.<br/> <br/>The clouds are also fundamental to the image - the dark band appearing as a barrier and, as if in abeyance, the upper part of the tree bends, seemingly unable to breach this ceiling so constructed.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really.<br/> <br/>Overall: I might have read a little too much into the image but it certainly serves to tell a fine story. Lovely work and certainly one that I underestimated on earlier passes.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: The mast, the tree, the spire - all grounded but aspiring for the sky. Above, the bird, free and ungrounded, makes a wonderful connection between the domains of earth and sky. The clouds are also fundamental to the image - the dark band appearing as a barrier and, as if in abeyance, the upper part of the tree bends, seemingly unable to breach this ceiling so constructed. Critical stuff: Nothing really. Overall: I might have read a little too much into the image but it certainly serves to tell a fine story. Lovely work and certainly one that I underestimated on earlier passes.', '2011-01-07 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274721, 926922, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love the restraint you have shown with your edit and your inclusion of the negative space above the sun. An 8 from me.</td>', 'I love the restraint you have shown with your edit and your inclusion of the negative space above the sun. An 8 from me.', '2011-01-07 08:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274883, 927337, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the top 4/5ths, but find the oof foreground very distracting. As presented I am wavering between a 5 or 6, but with a different crop or in camera framing, it may well have been a solid 8.</td>', 'Love the top 4/5ths, but find the oof foreground very distracting. As presented I am wavering between a 5 or 6, but with a different crop or in camera framing, it may well have been a solid 8.', '2011-01-07 12:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274884, 927257, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is some lovely light here, but I find the processing a tad on the heavy side.</td>', 'There is some lovely light here, but I find the processing a tad on the heavy side.', '2011-01-07 12:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274886, 927242, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a delightful little bird, and beautifully photographed!</td>', 'What a delightful little bird, and beautifully photographed!', '2011-01-07 12:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
