(6274907, 927257, 101702, '<td valign="top">Looks like a heavy dose of topaz... a little too much for my tastes, and also appears on a slight slant from left to right which I find the tiniest bit off-putting. I think I would have scored this more highly with the horizon level, and the large tree on the right sitting on a third. I just don''t like the way the sky through the tree is a lot lighter than the rest.</td>', 'Looks like a heavy dose of topaz... a little too much for my tastes, and also appears on a slight slant from left to right which I find the tiniest bit off-putting. I think I would have scored this more highly with the horizon level, and the large tree on the right sitting on a third. I just don''t like the way the sky through the tree is a lot lighter than the rest.', '2011-01-07 12:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6274921, 927069, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is cave cold, damp and drafty? Does large hungry sharptooth disturb sleep of tribe? Grog thought so. You need latest teknologee from Grog. Is called "fire". Is great advancement in comfort and convenience. Keeps females and younglings warm and safe. You call today. <strike>Grog</strike> Friendly operator stands by to take order.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=901409" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1248/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901409.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1248/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901409.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1248/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901409.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Is cave cold, damp and drafty? Does large hungry sharptooth disturb sleep of tribe? Grog thought so. You need latest teknologee from Grog. Is called "fire". Is great advancement in comfort and convenience. Keeps females and younglings warm and safe. You call today. Grog Friendly operator stands by to take order.', '2011-01-07 13:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
