(6274959, 925836, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s adorable!!  Add a shamrock and this little guy can be a St. Patrick''s Day holiday chicken LOL!<br/> <br/>I love the lighting, but even the darkness isn''t enough to take away from the cute factor.  Makes for an interesting contrast in moods depending on where I look.</td>', 'That''s adorable!!  Add a shamrock and this little guy can be a St. Patrick''s Day holiday chicken LOL! I love the lighting, but even the darkness isn''t enough to take away from the cute factor.  Makes for an interesting contrast in moods depending on where I look.', '2011-01-07 13:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
