(6275181, 926857, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, great tones and beautiful model. One of my pick for top 10, Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent composition, great tones and beautiful model. One of my pick for top 10, Good luck.', '2011-01-07 16:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
