(6275602, 927450, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous composition. Certainly challenging with a human subject. The lighting is perfect and your subject is engaged. I like her gnarled grip.</td>', 'Fabulous composition. Certainly challenging with a human subject. The lighting is perfect and your subject is engaged. I like her gnarled grip.', '2011-01-07 21:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
