(6275607, 927017, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this more because you didn''t boost the saturation and contrast through the roof to get ooh''s and ahh''s. So points from me for that (though it might be costing you points from the eye candy crowd!).</td>', 'I like this more because you didn''t boost the saturation and contrast through the roof to get ooh''s and ahh''s. So points from me for that (though it might be costing you points from the eye candy crowd!).', '2011-01-07 21:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
