(6276055, 927337, 86218, '<td valign="top">I feel like kicking your butt Philip. This could very well have ribboned or at least top 5. However..I believe I would not have to do it as you might be kicking yourself. Fantastic colours and element working so well but this could have been in another class. This photo had your signiture class pp work but I did not think it was yours for obvious reason. I put it down as you having less time to take pictures and being enclosed in the office... :)</td>', 'I feel like kicking your butt Philip. This could very well have ribboned or at least top 5. However..I believe I would not have to do it as you might be kicking yourself. Fantastic colours and element working so well but this could have been in another class. This photo had your signiture class pp work but I did not think it was yours for obvious reason. I put it down as you having less time to take pictures and being enclosed in the office... :)', '2011-01-08 05:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
