(6276167, 927186, 43463, '<td valign="top">One day we will get there to see this - wonder how crowded it will be after the last film debuts in July.... Love the tilt for it adds a quirky sense of wonder - maybe we are flying on a broomstick into Hogwarts:-) Love the slight sepia look for it gives it a sense of age...walking these streets hold history. Now I do have one critique: I wish that the sign ''Hogwarts'' was more prominent or rather the words on the sign were darker so they could pop more. Easy way to achieve that is use the select tool to select the letters and then lower brightness/contrast or the gamma.</td>', 'One day we will get there to see this - wonder how crowded it will be after the last film debuts in July.... Love the tilt for it adds a quirky sense of wonder - maybe we are flying on a broomstick into Hogwarts:-) Love the slight sepia look for it gives it a sense of age...walking these streets hold history. Now I do have one critique: I wish that the sign ''Hogwarts'' was more prominent or rather the words on the sign were darker so they could pop more. Easy way to achieve that is use the select tool to select the letters and then lower brightness/contrast or the gamma.', '2011-01-08 09:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
