(6276262, 927492, 124815, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! I feel vindicated. Although for my 6 photographs marked with 10 in this amazing challenge I would have hoped yours scored higher. Three of my marked 10 photos are placed in the top 10 - and I am so new to this site I feel like I shall just observe for a while and not be so cheeky as to vote!<br/>The angorables surely have a hypnotic quality and, again, the composition is masterly.</td>', 'Congratulations! I feel vindicated. Although for my 6 photographs marked with 10 in this amazing challenge I would have hoped yours scored higher. Three of my marked 10 photos are placed in the top 10 - and I am so new to this site I feel like I shall just observe for a while and not be so cheeky as to vote!The angorables surely have a hypnotic quality and, again, the composition is masterly.', '2011-01-08 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
