(6276307, 927388, 54645, '<td valign="top">What I find captivating by this image are the multiple transitions of depth and space. A difficult effect to achieve. Well done Don. Gave it an 8.<br/> <br/>ETA: I have a feeling the average DPCer would have cloned out many of the floating white "distractions" (dreaded DPC D word). I readily admit that I may have been that average DPCer if this image were in my hands! However, those distractions contributed to the transitions referenced above. A lesson to be learned by many.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-08 11:07:53.</i></td>', 'What I find captivating by this image are the multiple transitions of depth and space. A difficult effect to achieve. Well done Don. Gave it an 8. ETA: I have a feeling the average DPCer would have cloned out many of the floating white "distractions" (dreaded DPC D word). I readily admit that I may have been that average DPCer if this image were in my hands! However, those distractions contributed to the transitions referenced above. A lesson to be learned by many.', '2011-01-08 11:06:37.000000', '2011-01-08 11:07:53.000000', 0),
(6276308, 926144, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and a great portrait, Manny Librodo style. Congrats for PB.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and a great portrait, Manny Librodo style. Congrats for PB.', '2011-01-08 11:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6276309, 924940, 50695, '<td valign="top">Timfy, the composition is excellent. You''ve mastered light and many other aspects of photography. If you keep pushing the envelope with composition, you will be one he<strike>ll</strike>ck of an artist.</td>', 'Timfy, the composition is excellent. You''ve mastered light and many other aspects of photography. If you keep pushing the envelope with composition, you will be one hellck of an artist.', '2011-01-08 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
