(6276349, 927017, 110108, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this more because you didn''t boost the saturation and contrast through the roof to get ooh''s and ahh''s. So points from me for that (though it might be costing you points from the eye candy crowd!). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>well Brian, me too among the eye candy searching crowd :)<br/> <br/>but I could not pp it well :(</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: I like this more because you didn''t boost the saturation and contrast through the roof to get ooh''s and ahh''s. So points from me for that (though it might be costing you points from the eye candy crowd!).   well Brian, me too among the eye candy searching crowd :) but I could not pp it well :(', '2011-01-08 11:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
