(6276377, 927148, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Ben; I like how the dark wedge on the left waveline throws a tiny sense of tilt into this scene, hinting at the hurtling-through-space that underlies the absolute stillness of the scene-as-seen. I was one of your 8''s.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-08 12:17:20.</i></td>', 'Very nice, Ben; I like how the dark wedge on the left waveline throws a tiny sense of tilt into this scene, hinting at the hurtling-through-space that underlies the absolute stillness of the scene-as-seen. I was one of your 8''s.', '2011-01-08 12:17:00.000000', '2011-01-08 12:17:20.000000', 0),
(6276379, 926263, 30861, '<td valign="top">A lovely image and a fine finish. It felt just a bit too sharpened to me, the scene seems to want to be a little softer, so I ended up giving a 7 instead of an 8...<br/> <br/>Where was it taken? Looks vaguely familiar. PM me if you wish.</td>', 'A lovely image and a fine finish. It felt just a bit too sharpened to me, the scene seems to want to be a little softer, so I ended up giving a 7 instead of an 8... Where was it taken? Looks vaguely familiar. PM me if you wish.', '2011-01-08 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 0),
