s%201858%20-%201925/Susanna%20and%20the%20Elders,%20Second%20Version.jpg  and in this painting, *we* are the angoras: //www.topart168.com/pic/Reproduction_Painting%5CItaly%5CHayez,%20Francesco%201791%20-%201882%5CSusanna%20al%20bagno%20%5BSusanna%20Bathing%5D.jpg', '2011-01-08 12:46:50.000000', NULL, 0),
