(6957700, 927019, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot and the lighting is amazing.  Your daughter has flawless skin and a beautiful face.  You did an excellent job (as did she) in making her look like Twiggy ... I wish I knew my lighting system as well as you do.  Of course, I don''t take the time to study all the tips at strobist and other such sites.  I learn so much better from watching.  But getting back to you - kudos for creating this photo.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot and the lighting is amazing.  Your daughter has flawless skin and a beautiful face.  You did an excellent job (as did she) in making her look like Twiggy ... I wish I knew my lighting system as well as you do.  Of course, I don''t take the time to study all the tips at strobist and other such sites.  I learn so much better from watching.  But getting back to you - kudos for creating this photo.', '2013-01-15 01:52:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957775, 927019, 157380, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow! Hadn''t seen this before. The resemblance is uncanny. The photo is spectacular and the model is... well, stunning. But you knew that. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What he said (unsure if it''s ok for strangers to remark on the looks of ones daughter) <br/> <br/>Ive seen this before and studied it trying to work out why it''s great and how it isn''t spot on. seeing your inspirational image I worked out my suggestion is the background could be a little to vibrant and if it were a softer grey/white it may have scored better in the challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Wow! Hadn''t seen this before. The resemblance is uncanny. The photo is spectacular and the model is... well, stunning. But you knew that. :)   What he said (unsure if it''s ok for strangers to remark on the looks of ones daughter)  Ive seen this before and studied it trying to work out why it''s great and how it isn''t spot on. seeing your inspirational image I worked out my suggestion is the background could be a little to vibrant and if it were a softer grey/white it may have scored better in the challenge.', '2013-01-15 06:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
