(7615130, 925883, 115814, '<td valign="top">So here''s another uncommented photo that was among my picks in the "Pick your fav image from the person above you" side challenge several years back. This week I had the realization that "picking a favorite" should include a comment about why. So I''m back over the last 1600+ posts to make amends for my omission. Here''s my belated comment: <br/> <br/>I grew up at the beach near San Clemente and will always be drawn to the ocean, the shore, and the sea. This photo (and the story you posted about it) is wonderful. Full of spirit and whimsy. And as with your others, it holds up well to time.</td>', 'So here''s another uncommented photo that was among my picks in the "Pick your fav image from the person above you" side challenge several years back. This week I had the realization that "picking a favorite" should include a comment about why. So I''m back over the last 1600+ posts to make amends for my omission. Here''s my belated comment:  I grew up at the beach near San Clemente and will always be drawn to the ocean, the shore, and the sea. This photo (and the story you posted about it) is wonderful. Full of spirit and whimsy. And as with your others, it holds up well to time.', '2019-02-23 13:44:19.000000', NULL, 0);
